        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "At height \\(y\\), the radius is \\(x=y^2\\). Hence \\(V=\\pi\\int_0^1 (y^2)^2\\,dy=\\pi\\int_0^1y^4\\,dy=\\frac{\\pi}{5}\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
